description:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;JetBrains &lt;/strong&gt;creates professional tools that make developers more productive and help them focus on what matters. Our websites and web services are a core part of the JetBrains ecosystem. They connect us with users worldwide, power product distribution, support learning, and enable feedback loops at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are currently looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Software Developer &lt;/strong&gt;to join our&lt;strong&gt; Web Development team&lt;/strong&gt;. The ideal candidate will be someone who can take ownership of services end-to-end, from architecture and implementation to deployment and long-term support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and develop internal company-wide web applications and services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in the creation of solution architecture, from selecting approaches to decomposing services and defining their interactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain services running in AWS and Kubernetes-based environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop tools and platforms for localization workflows and integrate them with third-party systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve the reliability, scalability, and observability of our systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with other teams to evolve shared infrastructure and internal platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’ll be happy to have you on our team if you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong&amp;nbsp; 3- 5 years experience in backend web development using Kotlin or Java.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Node.js.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A solid understanding of modern backend frameworks (e.g. Ktor and Spring).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and building production-grade systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An understanding of distributed-system fundamentals (e.g. networking, fault tolerance, and scalability).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with cloud environments (AWS or similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with containerization and orchestration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to write clean, maintainable, and well-structured code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A willingness to take ownership of systems in production (including by offering support and assisting with continuous improvement).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good communication skills and a collaborative mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We would be especially thrilled if you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with infrastructure as code (e.g. Terraform).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with CI/CD pipelines and deployment automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with observability tools (e.g. metrics, logging, and tracing).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience using AI tools or agents in development workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Why join JetBrains?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong base salary. We offer competitive pay that reflects your skills and experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible work location. Enjoy the freedom to work from home or from the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remote work. Spend up to 30 days per year working remotely from abroad.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extra time off. More days to relax, recharge, and do the things you love.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical insurance allowance. Enjoy peace of mind for you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning and development opportunities. Access to conferences, courses, and language classes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relocation support. We help make your move as smooth and stress-free as possible.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Language classes. Pick up the local language or sharpen your English skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fuel your day. Enjoy a hot meal or receive a lunch allowance on workdays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health support. To help you feel your best, we provide easy access to professional mental health services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sports benefit. Enjoy an on-site gym or sports club stipend.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal events. Join company-wide celebrations and team gatherings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*Some benefits may vary depending on location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-MP1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We know great ideas can come from anyone, anywhere. That’s why we do our best to create an open and inclusive workplace – one that welcomes everyone regardless of their background, identity, religion, age, accessibility needs, or orientation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;We process the data provided in your job application in accordance with the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.jetbrains.com/legal/docs/privacy/privacy-recruitment/&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;At Stark, we forge the future of European and national security through cutting-edge, AI-driven technology and unmatched engineering precision. As a premier defence technology company, our mission is clear: to equip NATO Allies and their partners &amp;nbsp;with next-generation autonomous defence platforms and advanced AI-driven software built to perform in the world’s most demanding environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We believe that true security stems from relentless innovation. By combining elite engineering talent with agile technology and an AI-native operational culture, Stark turns complex defence challenges into field-tested, multi-domain solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;WHY JOIN US&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;The software and systems you work on directly protect personnel and defend European and national sovereignty.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You will work alongside industry-leading minds on autonomous systems, advanced propulsion, and secure cyber platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We foster a fast-paced, collaborative environment where bold ideas are supported by serious R&amp;amp;D backing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Minerva is STARK&#39;s command and control software — the brain that connects operators to autonomous systems across multiple domains in real time. The Minerva team is a small, senior software group based in Berlin and Munich, working directly with our systems and hardware teams to build mission-critical C2 capabilities deployed in active operational environments.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;We move fast, ship real software, and operate under constraints most engineers never encounter — low-bandwidth networks, air-gapped devices, high-stakes decision loops. There is no room for abstraction for its own sake. Everything we build ends up in the hands of real operators in the field.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Support the development, integration, testing, and operational use of tactical data link capabilities for STARK’s unmanned systems, Ground Control Stations, and wider command-and-control environments. You will help ensure that our systems can communicate reliably and securely with military networks, command posts, allied platforms, and mission systems. A key part of the role is to evaluate, understand, and integrate tactical communication standards and technologies such as Link 16, Link 22, SATCOM, and other military data link solutions. You will translate operational communication requirements into practical integration concepts, test setups, and deployable system configurations.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Tactical Data Link Integration:&amp;nbsp;Support the integration of tactical data link capabilities such as Link 16, Link 22, SATCOM, and other military communication systems into STARK platforms and Ground Control Station environments.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Interoperability Concepts:&amp;nbsp;Define and support communication concepts that enable reliable data exchange between unmanned systems, GCS setups, command centers, allied platforms, and external mission systems.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Requirements Translation:&amp;nbsp;Translate operational and military communication requirements into technical integration requirements, interface definitions, test needs, and subsystem-level implementation concepts.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;System Interface Support:&amp;nbsp;Work with engineering, software, network, RF, modem, antenna, and GCS teams to align interfaces, protocols, data flows, configuration requirements, and integration constraints.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;SATCOM &amp;amp; Beyond-Line-of-Sight Support:&amp;nbsp;Support concepts and integration activities for SATCOM, long-range communication paths, and other beyond-line-of-sight connectivity options.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Testing &amp;amp; Validation:&amp;nbsp;Plan and support lab tests, field tests, interoperability checks, and validation activities for tactical data link and communication setups.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Security &amp;amp; Reliability:&amp;nbsp;Contribute to secure, robust, and mission-ready communication architectures, considering availability, latency, data integrity, authentication, and operational constraints.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supplier &amp;amp; Partner Coordination:&amp;nbsp;Work with external suppliers, partners, military stakeholders, and internal teams to assess data link options, integration dependencies, and technical feasibility.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Documentation:&amp;nbsp;Document data link concepts, interface assumptions, configuration settings, integration dependencies, test results, and recommended operational setups in a clear and maintainable way.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Experience:&amp;nbsp;Around 5 years of professional experience in tactical communications, military data links, SATCOM, RF systems, communication engineering, systems engineering, or a related technical field.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Tactical Data Link Knowledge:&amp;nbsp;Practical understanding of military data link technologies such as Link 16, Link 22, SATCOM, or comparable tactical communication systems.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Systems Understanding:&amp;nbsp;Ability to understand complex communication architectures involving platforms, radios, antennas, modems, networks, command systems, software interfaces, and operational workflows.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Interoperability Mindset:&amp;nbsp;Strong understanding of how different systems exchange data, how interfaces are defined, and how interoperability is tested and validated.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Technical Communication:&amp;nbsp;Ability to translate between operational users, engineering teams, software developers, RF specialists, suppliers, and program stakeholders.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Testing &amp;amp; Documentation:&amp;nbsp;Experience supporting technical tests, integration trials, validation activities, or operational demonstrations, including structured documentation of results and findings.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Problem-Solving Ability:&amp;nbsp;Strong analytical mindset with the ability to identify communication issues, integration gaps, configuration problems, and practical solutions.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Communication:&amp;nbsp;Solid English skills are required. German skills for technical communication, stakeholder alignment, and documentation are a plus.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Team Fit:&amp;nbsp;Ability to work collaboratively in a small, cross-functional team and communicate clearly and reliably in fast-moving engineering environments.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Clearance:&amp;nbsp;Ability to obtain appropriate security clearance required for the position.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice-To-Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Experience in defence, military communications, command-and-control systems, aerospace, naval systems, UAVs, or other mission-critical operational environments.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;· Prior exposure to NATO communication standards, tactical networks, joint fires, air defence, command posts, or battlefield management systems.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;· Experience with SATCOM terminals, tactical radios, MANET, IP-based tactical networks, or professional communication equipment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;· Experience integrating unmanned systems into wider military communication architectures.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;· Understanding of network security, encryption concepts, authentication, routing, IP networking, and secure data exchange.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;If you&#39;re interested in building the future of European Defence with us, and you see yourself reflected on the description above, please send us your &lt;strong&gt;CV in English&lt;/strong&gt;. We&#39;re looking forward to meeting you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SECURITY CLEARANCE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Due to the nature of our work in the defence sector, candidates must be eligible to obtain and maintain the appropriate security clearance required for this position. Details will be provided during the recruitment process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EQUAL OPPORTUNITY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We are an equal-opportunity employer committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive workplace. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, colour, religion, sex, national origin, disability, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;At Stark, we forge the future of European and national security through cutting-edge, AI-driven technology and unmatched engineering precision. As a premier defence technology company, our mission is clear: to equip NATO Allies and their partners &amp;nbsp;with next-generation autonomous defence platforms and advanced AI-driven software built to perform in the world’s most demanding environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We believe that true security stems from relentless innovation. By combining elite engineering talent with agile technology and an AI-native operational culture, Stark turns complex defence challenges into field-tested, multi-domain solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;WHY JOIN US&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;The software and systems you work on directly protect personnel and defend European and national sovereignty.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You will work alongside industry-leading minds on autonomous systems, advanced propulsion, and secure cyber platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We foster a fast-paced, collaborative environment where bold ideas are supported by serious R&amp;amp;D backing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR MISSION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a versatile Software Engineer specializing in embedded systems and low-level communication services. In this role, you will drive the development of a mission-critical deployment tool and hardware communication services for specialized operating systems. While being familiar with CI/CD pipelines, your primary focus will be on software development for mission-critical procedures, utilization of agentic AI and Typescript environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU WILL DO AT STARK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead Developer for our mission-critical preparation tool: Maintain and evolve the tool built in Typescript.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the main technical point of contact and support lead for internal teams and customer requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilize Agentic AI: As an AI focused company we encourage our employees to leverage our state-of-art AI development infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CI/CD Pipeline Management: Work with our automated GitLab CI/CD pipelines for building, testing, packaging, and deploying GCS software components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop, deploy, and troubleshoot software solutions running on Linux-based systems, particularly Ubuntu.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;API &amp;amp; Interface Integration: Develop and maintain APIs and software interfaces to integrate radios, networking equipment, hardware components, and external systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration: Work closely with hardware, network, systems engineering, and GCS integration teams to translate technical requirements into practical software solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING TO THE MISSION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of professional experience in software development, software integration, or a related technical field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core Languages: Proficiency in Typescript or Python.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tooling &amp;amp; Support: Proven track record in maintaining production-critical tools and providing tier-2/3 technical support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CI/CD Expertise: Practical experience with GitLab CI/CD, Git-based workflows, automated builds, testing pipelines, and software deployment processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;API Development: Experience developing and integrating REST APIs, HTTP/HTTPS interfaces, and network-based software services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Networking Fundamentals: Good understanding of TCP/IP, UDP, network protocols, authentication, and communication interfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Software Engineering: Solid understanding of software architecture, version control, dependency management, automated testing, and release management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eligibility to obtain a German / NATO security clearance (EU / NATO citizenship required by national security regulations).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NICE TO HAVE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with NVIDIA Jetson, Raspberry Pi, or similar ARM64 SBCs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Awareness of ROS 2 (colcon, ament, uXRCE-DDS).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with GCP (Artifact Registry, Cloud Build, GCE instances).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Base knowledge of C++.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;If you&#39;re interested in building the future of European Defence with us, and you see yourself reflected on the description above, please send us your &lt;strong&gt;CV in English&lt;/strong&gt;. We&#39;re looking forward to meeting you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SECURITY CLEARANCE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Due to the nature of our work in the defence sector, candidates must be eligible to obtain and maintain the appropriate security clearance required for this position. Details will be provided during the recruitment process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EQUAL OPPORTUNITY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We are an equal-opportunity employer committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive workplace. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, colour, religion, sex, national origin, disability, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;At Stark, we forge the future of European and national security through cutting-edge, AI-driven technology and unmatched engineering precision. As a premier defence technology company, our mission is clear: to equip NATO Allies and their partners &amp;nbsp;with next-generation autonomous defence platforms and advanced AI-driven software built to perform in the world’s most demanding environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We believe that true security stems from relentless innovation. By combining elite engineering talent with agile technology and an AI-native operational culture, Stark turns complex defence challenges into field-tested, multi-domain solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;WHY JOIN US&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;The software and systems you work on directly protect personnel and defend European and national sovereignty.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You will work alongside industry-leading minds on autonomous systems, advanced propulsion, and secure cyber platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We foster a fast-paced, collaborative environment where bold ideas are supported by serious R&amp;amp;D backing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Minerva is STARK&#39;s command and control software — the brain that connects operators to autonomous systems across multiple domains in real time. The Minerva team is a small, senior software group based in Berlin and Munich, working directly with our systems and hardware teams to build mission-critical C2 capabilities deployed in active operational environments.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;We move fast, ship real software, and operate under constraints most engineers never encounter — low-bandwidth networks, air-gapped devices, high-stakes decision loops. There is no room for abstraction for its own sake. Everything we build ends up in the hands of real operators in the field.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;As a Robotics Engineer with a focus on embedded perception systems, you will play a critical role in enabling real-time autonomy onboard next-generation UAV platforms. You will work directly with camera data pipelines, ROS2-based systems, and embedded compute platforms to build robust, efficient, and scalable perception functionality.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;You will contribute as a highly skilled individual contributor—hands-on with the system—bridging diverse codebases and enabling data flows across native ROS2 nodes, legacy frameworks, and containerized third-party modules. Your work will be essential to ensuring that our autonomous systems operate reliably in real-world, resource-constrained environments.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Develop and integrate real-time perception pipelines on embedded platforms such as the Jetson Nano NX.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Migrate legacy monolithic systems to ROS2, refactoring and modularizing components for better scalability and maintainability.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Enable and optimize image data access across native and containerized components (e.g., Dockerized ROS2 processes).&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Design and implement low-level camera and sensor drivers for real-time vision acquisition.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Collaborate with AI, controls, and hardware teams to ensure tight integration between perception and other onboard subsystems.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Profile and debug system performance under embedded constraints (compute, thermal, bandwidth), ensuring stability and robustness in field deployments.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Contribute to system-level architecture discussions with a focus on communication reliability and modularity.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in Engineering or a related technical field.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Strong experience with ROS2, including real-world deployment and integration of perception modules.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Proficient in Python and C++ for embedded and robotics development.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Solid background in robotics, autonomous systems, embedded development, or aerospace applications.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Familiarity with embedded Linux platforms, particularly NVIDIA Jetson devices.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Experience integrating containerized processes (e.g., Docker) into onboard robotic systems.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ability to navigate and coordinate between different frameworks (ROS2, legacy/custom codebases, third-party modules).&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Strong problem-solving and debugging skills, especially in real-time or resource-constrained environments.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Effective communicator and team player in multidisciplinary engineering teams.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Self-driven, organized, and adaptable to fast-paced development cycles.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Willingness to travel occasionally for field testing and deployment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;If you&#39;re interested in building the future of European Defence with us, and you see yourself reflected on the description above, please send us your &lt;strong&gt;CV in English&lt;/strong&gt;. We&#39;re looking forward to meeting you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
