&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Everpure (NYSE: P) has evolved from storage pioneer to data platform, closing fiscal 2026 with $3.7 billion in revenue, its first billion-dollar quarter, and accelerating growth into FY27. Our strategic agenda spans the companies defining the next era of technology - hyperscalers, AI labs, the AI hardware supply chain, data platform providers, and the broader AI ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This type of work—work that changes the world—is what the tech industry was founded on. So, if you&#39;re ready to seize the endless opportunities and leave your mark, come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Consulting Systems Engineer Germany, Strategic Accounts&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(Automotive)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Do you keep up with the latest trends, are you a disruptive thinker and do you have experience of driving cultural change in organisations? If Yes - then this is the right role for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Strategic Accounts business is the growth area for Everpure and the Client Technical Director (CTD), known internally as a - Consulting System Engineer (CSE) - is a key role in engaging new and existing Automotive clients in conversations to help them transition from traditional storage-centric models to a modern data platform - unlocking the power of their data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Client Technical Director you are a senior level technical Solutions Architect who will work with and focus on Everpure’s Strategic clients -&amp;nbsp; for this role it will be German Automotive clients with a focus on southern Germany, plus other selected accounts. In turn, you will also work in collaboration with Everpure’s Enterprise and Field pre-sales and account teams&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are expected also to have a detailed grasp of IT industry trends, broad and deep IT industry experience (especially Automotive, their Tier 1 suppliers and ecosystems, plus the wider Manufacturing supply chain and build demands) and a high degree of business acumen and will be working in the forefront of Everpure&#39;s global sales capability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be required to work closely with your customer base (so frequent travel within Germany is a strong requirement), building a trusted relationship, identifying and quantifying outcome based opportunities that can be delivered from our portfolio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You must be knowledgeable across industry, business, IT strategy, use cases and technology domains and be comfortable presenting to C-Suite clients, discussing process with business managers or working with developers on solution strategy, architecture and code, and with storage admins designing operating models – from boardroom to hackathon to storage ops. Critically you will be accustomed to creating a value proposition that is directly linked to a client’s business model, challenges and issues plus their future vision.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be an expert in quickly learning new business models and drivers and will be able to articulate, to multiple customer stakeholder personas across different regions and countries. This will include presenting and explaining the benefits and differentiators of our chosen technology, how our solution has been mapped to meet their industry, business and operational requirements, our implementation methods, and the proposed commercial and financial models.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Building and articulating financial and commercial models with their benefits to our customers, and internal stakeholders is a key aspect of the ever evolving role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It is expected that you will be able to translate our core values, differentiators and capabilities across our portfolio, plus articulate previous customer success stories, benefits seen and acknowledged by customers with known outcomes to multiple levels of stakeholders within the strategic accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have gravitas and authenticity. You will be expected to have first class interpersonal skills combined with a comfortable, open and compelling communication and presentation style. You also bring a high degree of diplomacy and a strong EQ.&amp;nbsp; It is imperative that we can look at our value propositions from the viewpoint of our customers, therefore empathy is critical.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;SHOULD YOU ACCEPT THIS CHALLENGE, AS A CTD AT EVERPURE YOU WILL WORK ON...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Use Case Development and Solution Definition:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Define &lt;strong&gt;end‑to‑end solutions and use cases&lt;/strong&gt; that address the specific realities of &lt;strong&gt;German and global Automotives &lt;/strong&gt;– from production and supply chain to digital services and connected vehicles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Shape our &lt;strong&gt;global automotive strategy and footprint&lt;/strong&gt; across the largest German OEMs and suppliers by mapping industry trends, business drivers, and technical requirements to Everpure’s portfolio and ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Influence &lt;strong&gt;implementation methods, technology choices and commercial / financial models&lt;/strong&gt; so that our solutions deliver clear, measurable outcomes for customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Understand stakeholders, their drivers, challenges, their goals and expectations, and effectively communicate the right messages to them. You will spend a large portion of your time with your customers face to face, (in and around Germany primarily, but also globally covering the leading German Automotive accounts), your partners, Alliances, Global Integrators and key stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Financial Acumen:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Calculate Total Cost of Ownership scenarios for customers, explaining how they align with their challenges and Everpure’s benefits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Leadership and Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead large IT projects, establish yourself as a thought leader and trusted advisor, collaborate with sales, engineering, and product management teams. Have experience of working across multiple global and local partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Collateral Production&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Create client collateral, including presentations, papers, demonstrations, proofs of concepts, and contribute to joint offerings with other Everpure teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Sales Guidance:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Guide the Sales team in &lt;strong&gt;positioning, shaping and closing&lt;/strong&gt; the right solutions in a competitive environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Technical Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Provide &lt;strong&gt;technical leadership and mentoring&lt;/strong&gt; for the local and regional Systems Engineering organisation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Represent Pure at &lt;strong&gt;industry events, field marketing activities and communities&lt;/strong&gt; (including those focused on women in tech and diverse talent).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Market Insight:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Track &lt;strong&gt;key trends in Automotive and Manufacturing&lt;/strong&gt; (e.g. software‑defined vehicles ADAS &amp;amp; AD, Industry 4.0, sustainability, data sovereignty and primacy &amp;amp; AI) and connect them to Everpure’s technology strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Understand the &lt;strong&gt;competitive landscape&lt;/strong&gt; and be able to articulate where Pure differentiates and how our solutions support the German market’s specific requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bring back &lt;strong&gt;customer and market insights&lt;/strong&gt; to influence our roadmap and go‑to‑market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Culture &amp;amp; Inclusion:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Help maintain and evolve Everpure’s &lt;strong&gt;technical and customer‑first culture&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Act as a role model who &lt;strong&gt;creates inclusive environments&lt;/strong&gt;, supports diverse talent, and helps us attract and retain top technical people&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL NEED TO EXCEL IN THIS ROLE...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1.Technical Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong technical background across &lt;strong&gt;infrastructure and data&lt;/strong&gt;: storage, compute, databases, networking, virtualisation and/or cloud‑native architectures.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Solid experience with &lt;strong&gt;data management and storage technologies&lt;/strong&gt;, and how they support mission‑critical workloads in Automotive and Manufacturing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Understanding of &lt;strong&gt;key manufacturing processes and outcomes&lt;/strong&gt;, and a &lt;strong&gt;deep appreciation of the Automotive value chain&lt;/strong&gt; – OEMs, Tier 1 suppliers, production plants, logistics and digital services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Versatility:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Familiarity with areas such as &lt;strong&gt;data &amp;amp; analytics / data science, modern IT architecture modelling, Agile and DevOps, automation and infrastructure as code, IT operations and IT security&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to quickly learn new platforms, tools and architectures and &lt;strong&gt;translate them into simple, business‑relevant language&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Strategic Thinking:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience working with &lt;strong&gt;large, global or strategic accounts&lt;/strong&gt; – ideally in or with German enterprise customers (automotive experience is beneficial)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to move comfortably between &lt;strong&gt;big‑picture strategy&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;hands‑on detail&lt;/strong&gt;, and to structure complex problems into clear options and recommendations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Communication Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Outstanding communication skills in &lt;strong&gt;German and English&lt;/strong&gt; (Native/Bilingual German and business‑fluent English required).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Confidence in presenting to &lt;strong&gt;C‑Level, senior business leaders and technical teams&lt;/strong&gt; – and in facilitating workshops where different perspectives need to be heard.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;High &lt;strong&gt;emotional intelligence, empathy and diplomacy&lt;/strong&gt;; you naturally build trust and foster collaborative discussions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Industry Knowledge&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong understanding of &lt;strong&gt;commercial and disruptive technology trends&lt;/strong&gt; in the Automotive and Manufacturing markets in Germany, with existing relationships within southern Germany automotives strongly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Knowledge of major &lt;strong&gt;competitors and partner ecosystems&lt;/strong&gt;, and the ability to position Pure’s differentiators for the right use cases.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Learning Orientation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;growth and learning orientation&lt;/strong&gt; – you actively invest in your own development and stay curious about new technologies, methods and industry trends.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Willingness to dedicate a minimum of &lt;strong&gt;10% of your time&lt;/strong&gt; to training, certifications and participation in industry and community events.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU CAN EXPECT FROM US:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;: We celebrate those who think critically, like a challenge, and aspire to be trailblazers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth&lt;/strong&gt;: We give you the space and support to grow along with us and to contribute to something meaningful. We have been named Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces in Technology™, Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces in the Bay Area™, and certified as a Great Place to Work®!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;/strong&gt;: We build each other up and set aside ego for the greater good.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;And because we understand the value of bringing your full and best self to work, we offer a variety of perks to manage a healthy balance, including flexible time off, wellness resources, and company-sponsored team events. Check out &lt;a href=&quot;http://benefits.everpuredata.com/&quot;&gt;http://benefits.everpuredata.com/ &lt;/a&gt;for more information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ACCOMMODATIONS AND ACCESSIBILITY:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates with disabilities may request accommodations for all aspects of our hiring process. For more on this, contact us at &lt;a ---------- if you’re invited to an interview.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OUR COMMITMENT TO A STRONG AND INCLUSIVE TEAM:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re forging a future where everyone finds their rightful place and where every voice matters. Where uniqueness isn’t just accepted but embraced. That’s why we are committed to fostering the growth and development of every person, cultivating a sense of community through our Employee Resource Groups and advocating for inclusive leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Everpure is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender, gender identity, gender expression, transgender status, sexual stereotypes, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, or any other characteristic legally protected by the laws of the jurisdiction in which you are being considered for hire.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us and bring your best.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bring your bold.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pure and simple.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Grafana Labs is the company behind Grafana Cloud, the fully managed observability platform trusted by more than 10,000 organizations to ensure reliability, resolve incidents faster, and optimize telemetry at scale. Built on open source and open standards and designed for interoperability across any stack, Grafana Cloud brings AI to observability and observability to AI, giving teams (and their agents) unified visibility so they can see, understand, and act on all their disparate data, wherever it lives, and move at the speed of their ambitions. Customers, including Anthropic, Bloomberg, NVIDIA, Microsoft, and Salesforce, rely on Grafana Labs. We are a 100% remote company with team members across 40+ countries, backed by leading investors including Lightspeed Venture Partners, Sequoia Capital, GIC, Coatue, J.P. Morgan, CapitalG, and Lead Edge Capital. Learn more at &lt;u&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://grafana.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;grafana.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt; and follow us on &lt;u&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/grafana-labs/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt; and &lt;u&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/grafana&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;.&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re scaling fast and staying true to what makes us different: an open-source legacy, a global collaborative culture, and a passion for meaningful work. Our team thrives in an innovation-driven environment where transparency, autonomy, and trust fuel everything we do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You may not meet every requirement, and that’s okay. If this role excites you, we’d love you to raise your hand for what could be a truly career-defining opportunity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Grafana Labs is looking for a technically fluent engineer who loves building powerful demos, explaining complex systems clearly, and helping SRE and platform engineering leaders understand the value of our open approach to observability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Grafana’s offering shifts from dashboards to industry-leading agentic observability, our Product Marketing team is responsible for closing the gap between what our products can do and how customers understand that value. That means building clear, consistent positioning, enabling sellers with trustworthy technical narratives, and creating content that helps Platform Engineering teams quickly grasp why Grafana Cloud is the right choice for them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Technical Product Marketer you will play a critical part in that transformation. You’ll be the hands-on engineer who brings our technical story to life for buyers, not just practitioners. You’ll build core demos, run technical workshops and webinars, and act as the technical bridge between our Product and Sales orgs. Your work will help SRE and platform engineering leaders evaluate Grafana with confidence, equip sales engineers with better tools and talk tracks, and ensure our technical value shows up clearly and consistently across the entire customer journey.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a unique chance to shape how Grafana tells its story as we evolve our positioning in the AI era, strengthen seller enablement, and build a repeatable system for communicating product value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build strategic, buyer-focused demos, videos, workshops, and webinars&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and maintain polished, narrative-driven demos that highlight Grafana’s value for SRE and platform engineering leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Record high-quality technical demo videos and walkthroughs in partnership with our video and content teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead webinars, workshops, and technical sessions designed for evaluators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Teach customers not just how Grafana works, but why our approach is differentiated and valuable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI tools to generate variations, summaries, and reusable assets that scale technical content across channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enable Solutions (Sales) Engineers with clear, consistent technical storytelling&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as PMM’s technical liaison to the SE org, ensuring consistent messaging and demo guidance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce technical enablement assets, value-driven talk tracks, competitive narratives, and demo best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help SEs and sellers communicate Grafana’s story with clarity, confidence, and differentiation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate with PMMs to drive technical buyer engagement across high-impact channels&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with PMMs to identify the most important buyer personas, problems, and technical messages, and help shape the content strategy needed to reach them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extend technical narratives into impactful buyer-facing channels including analyst briefings (Gartner, Forrester), industry forums, podcasts, conferences, and online technical communities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring a technical perspective to PMM planning—helping ensure our content, campaigns, and enablement reflect the real challenges and priorities of SREs and engineering leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use automation &amp;amp; AI to scale technical content&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with software engineers to streamline demo setup, content workflows, and asset updates through workflows, agents, scripts, and AI-driven tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use automation to make technical content more repeatable, discoverable, and scalable across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Makes You a Great Fit:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in a technical role (solutions engineering, SRE, DevOps, backend engineering, technical PMM, or similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest and ability to travel to training and customer events 10-12 weeks per year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of observability concepts and the needs of SRE/platform teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to translate deep technical concepts into clear, value-focused stories.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience presenting technical content through demos, workshops, or webinars.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication, with a crisp, structured, persuasive style.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cross-functional collaboration; comfort working with PMM, Product, SEs, DevRel, and Field Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High ownership mindset with the ability to drive projects from concept to completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with light scripting or workflow automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with Grafana, Prometheus, Loki, Mimir, Tempo, or similar observability tools, or a background in Observability or Platform Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in Sales Engineering, DevRel, or technical product marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with demo environment automation or infrastructure-as-code tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional live presentation or workshop facilitation skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Rewards:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In Germany, the base compensation range for this role is EUR 109,709 - EUR 131,651. Actual compensation may vary based on level, experience, and skillset as assessed throughout the interview process. All of our roles include Restricted Stock Units (RSUs), giving every team member ownership in Grafana Labs&#39; success. We believe in shared outcomes—RSUs help us stay aligned and invested as we scale globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;*Compensation ranges are country specific. If you are applying for this role from a different location than listed above, your recruiter will discuss your specific market’s defined pay range &amp;amp; benefits at the beginning of the process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You’ll Thrive at Grafana Labs:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;100% Remote, Global Culture -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;As a remote-only company, we bring together talent from around the world, united by a culture of collaboration and shared purpose.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scaling Organization&lt;/strong&gt; – Tackle meaningful work in a high-growth, ever-evolving environment.&lt;/li&gt;
